---
/**
 * Single column, copy only — DESIGN-NOTES §6.1 bans hero art, and the four
 * trust facts live only in the TrustBar directly below (§6b.3). Type and
 * whitespace hold the space; the TrustBar closes the fold.
 */
---
<section>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-site px-5 pt-14 pb-14 md:px-8 md:pt-24 md:pb-20 lg:pt-28 lg:pb-24">
    <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-eyebrow font-semibold uppercase text-steel">
      <span class="dot dot--pulse"></span>IT partner za mala preduzeća
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-[15em] text-h1 font-bold">Računari, mreža i licence&nbsp;— da jednostavno rade.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-[54ch] text-lead text-steel">
      IT oprema i podrška za mala preduzeća. Jedan partner, predvidiv mesečni trošak,
      bez komplikacija — u Beogradu i remote, širom Srbije.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="#kontakt" class="btn btn-primary">Zakažite besplatan pregled</a>
      <a href="/shop" class="btn btn-secondary">Pogledajte opremu</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
